.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
.TH sparsemap 3 "2026-05-13" "sparsemap 1.0.0" "Sparsemap Library"
.SH NAME
sparsemap \- sparse, compressed bitmap with run-length encoding
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sparsemap/sparsemap.h>
.PP
.BI "sparsemap_t *sparsemap_create(size_t " size );
.BI "void sparsemap_free(sparsemap_t *" map );
.BI "uint64_t sparsemap_add(sparsemap_t *" map ", uint64_t " idx );
.BI "bool sparsemap_contains(sparsemap_t *" map ", uint64_t " idx );
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sparsemap is a mutable, resizable, compressed bitmap optimized for
workloads with long runs of consecutive set or unset bits.  See
\fBsparsemap\fR(7) for the conceptual overview and the project's
\fIdocs/API.md\fR for the full API reference.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sparsemap (7)
